      <section class="content photo-gallery">

         <h2 class="center">
            <picture>
               <source media="(min-width:1000px)" srcset="img/top/title/title-photogallery-pc.png">
               <img src="img/top/title/title-photogallery-sp.png" alt="">
            </picture>
            <span class="visually-hidden">フォトギャラリー（PHOTO GALLERY）</span>
         </h2>

         <div class="gallery-content flex">

            <div class="gallery-engine">
               <div class="gallery-main relative">

                  <button class="absolute gallery-arrow prev" aria-label="previous">
                     <svg class="absolute" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="white"
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <polyline points="12 4 6 10 12 16" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" fill="none"
                           stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                     </svg>
                  </button>
                  <a href="photo-gallery/index.html"><img class="absolute gallery-main-image"
                        src="photo-gallery/img/2026/2612-photo.webp" alt=""></a>

                  <button class="absolute gallery-arrow next" aria-label="next">
                     <svg class="absolute" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="white"
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <polyline points="8 4 14 10 8 16" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" fill="none"
                           stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                     </svg>
                  </button>

               </div>

               <div class="flex gallery-thumbs">
                  <img src="photo-gallery/img/2026/2612-photo.webp" data-full="photo-gallery/img/2026/2612-photo.webp"
                     class="current" alt="">
                  <img src="photo-gallery/img/2026/2611-photo.webp" data-full="photo-gallery/img/2026/2611-photo.webp"
                     alt="">
                  <img src="photo-gallery/img/2026/2610-photo.webp" data-full="photo-gallery/img/2026/2610-photo.webp"
                     alt="">
                  <img src="photo-gallery/img/2026/2609-photo.jpg" data-full="photo-gallery/img/2026/2609-photo.jpg"
                     alt="">
                  <img src="photo-gallery/img/2026/2608-photo.jpg" data-full="photo-gallery/img/2026/2608-photo.jpg"
                     alt="">
               </div>
            </div>

            <div class="gallery-side relative">

               <div class="absolute bg-p-center bg-r bg-s-contain leaf-1"></div>
               <div class="absolute bg-p-center bg-r bg-s-contain leaf-2"></div>

               <div class="absolute bg-switcher bg-r bg-p-center bg-s-contain anime-camera" data-interval="2"
                  data-images='["img/anime/camera-1.png","img/anime/camera-2.png"]'></div> <!-- カメラマンのアニメーション -->

               <div class="absolute bg-switcher bg-r bg-p-center bg-s-contain anime-momonga" data-interval="2"
                  data-images='["img/anime/momonga-1.png","img/anime/momonga-2.png"]'></div> <!-- モモンガのアニメーション -->

               <p class="more more-bk flex"><a href="photo-gallery/" class="bg-r bg-s-cover flex"><img
                        src="img/top/button/top-more-bk.png" alt=""><span class="visually-hidden">もっと見る</span></a></p>

            </div>

         </div>

      </section>


      <div class="flex layout">

         <section class="content box card relative leaflet-content"> <!-- 労山リーフ -->

            <div class="absolute bg-s-contain bg-r acorn"></div>

            <h2 class="absolute">
               <picture>
                  <source media="(min-width:1000px)" srcset="img/top/title/title-leaflet-pc.png">
                  <img src="img/top/title/title-leaflet-sp.png" alt="">
               </picture>
               <span class="visually-hidden">労山リーフ</span>
            </h2>

            <div class="flex column">
               <div class="card-txt">
                  <p>A4・三つ折りのリーフレットができました。表面中央（三つ折りした状態で裏面になります）の下の白い囲みに連盟・クラブ紹介を印刷できます。１団体につき年間200部まで全国事務所で無料でお作りします。
                  </p>
               </div>
               <div class="card-ph second-half">
                  <picture>
                     <source media="(min-width:1000px)" srcset="img/top/thumbnail/leaflet-pc.png">
                     <img src="img/top/thumbnail/leaflet-sp.png" alt="">
                  </picture>
               </div>
               <p class="more contact-more flex"><a href="form/contact/" class="bg-r bg-s-cover flex"><img
                        src="img/top/button/top-contact.png" alt=""><span class="visually-hidden">お申し込みはこちら</span></a>
               </p>
            </div>

         </section>

         <section class="content sns-content box card relative"> <!-- フェイスブック -->

            <div class="absolute bg-switcher bg-r bg-p-center bg-s-contain anime-bare" data-interval="2"
               data-images='["img/anime/bare-1.png","img/anime/bare-2.png"]'></div> <!-- クマのアニメーション -->

            <h2 class="absolute">
               <picture>
                  <source media="(min-width:1000px)" srcset="img/top/title/title-fb-pc.png">
                  <img src="img/top/title/title-fb-sp.png" alt="">
               </picture>
               <span class="visually-hidden">Facebook</span>
            </h2>

            <div class="flex column">

               <div class="card-txt">
                  <!-- <p>youtubeで体操を公開しています。<br>体操を日課にして、日頃から登山できる体作りをしておきましょう。</p> -->
               </div>

               <div class="card-ph second-half">
                  <div id="fb-root"></div>
                  <a href="https://www.facebook.com/JapanWorkersAlpineFederation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                     <img src="img/top/link/facebook-capture.png" alt="日本勤労者山岳連盟 Facebookページ" style="max-width:100%;">
